WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:02.400
This girl is Kouyama Mitsuki. 12 years old!

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.560
The other day we went to Hiiragi Preschool to give a mini-concert...

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:08.400
...but a boy was causing all kinds of mischief!

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.080
Actually... it was because he would've been separated from a girl he loved right after the concert.{edited}

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:16.240
<i>Full Moon</i>  had the same sad experience, so, as a present, she sang to them with all her heart. {She said "that girl", but ...}

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.990
I was moved by that song, too...

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.070
Well, then...

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:22.870
...I wonder what's going to happen today.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:23.450
Huh?

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:28.820
Do you understand?

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:29.670
Yes.

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:12.790
Ooshige-san sure is late...{edited}

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:16.070
And also... Takuto and Meroko aren't here today either...{edited} {shani: woohoo~ Tachi is back!}

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:44.550
Well... it looks like Takuto and Meroko have their own work to do...

00:02:44.550 --> 00:02:45.670
Guess it can't be helped, huh?

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:48.220
But where's Ooshige-san...?

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:54.050
Hello! Ooshige-san?! {End time fixed}

00:02:55.830 --> 00:02:57.520
Eh? Why's that?

00:02:58.940 --> 00:02:59.630
What?!

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:01.190
You're in the hospital?! {Probably drank too much}

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:08.810
Yes. Well...

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:11.480
That's why...

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:15.500
Today, Akiba-kun will be 
your manager in my place.

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:16.200
Ah.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:18.040
Okay. I understand.

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:19.440
Yes. Okay.

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:21.240
Then... get well soon!

00:03:21.990 --> 00:03:22.920
Ah...

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:25.550
Somehow... this is turning out to be a rough day...

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:26.380
Oh yeah.

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:28.010
Akiba-san, who's coming in her place...

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:29.680
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:31.010
<i>Full Moon</i>-san!

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:35.680
U-Um...

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:37.130
Y-You've got the wrong person!

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:37.640
Huh?

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:41.150
Um...

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:42.480
Akiba-san?

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:43.230
Yes?

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:44.440
That's me...

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:46.110
Nice to meet you!

00:03:46.110 --> 00:03:46.900
I'm <i>Full Moon</i>.

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:50.030
P-Pardon me!

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:53.280
I'm Akiba Kotarou, your substitute 
manager for today!

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:56.110
I couldn't recognize you because 
you were in disguise...

00:03:56.110 --> 00:03:58.000
I'm so happy to see how lovely you are! {edited}

00:03:58.350 --> 00:03:58.830
Ah.

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:02.880
Ooshige-san told me to wear a disguise whenever I'm somewhere with a lot of people.{}

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:04.880
Just as one would expect from Ooshige-senpai!

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:06.850
It'd be bad if fans saw you here, right?

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:07.400
However...

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:08.990
Today... I, Akiba Kotarou...

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:11.020
...will give you such management that won't lose to Senpai's...

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:13.010
...and fully support you in every step of the way!

00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:15.760
So please, rest assured!

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:17.680
<i>Full Moon</i>-san!

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:19.250
Wow! It's <i>Full Moon</i> !

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:20.420
It really is!

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:21.810
Signature, please...

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:21.810
She's so cute!

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:23.900
Oh no! I've already made a mistake!{}

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:25.230
But it will be all right!

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:31.460
We can get away now!

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:31.910
Let's go!

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:32.360
Ah!

00:04:36.430 --> 00:04:38.410
Looks like we managed to get away.

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:42.480
Well, then, for our first job today...

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:44.130
Let's go to the autograph session!

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:44.940
Yes!

00:04:44.940 --> 00:04:47.380
But... where are we?

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:48.880
Uh...

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:51.160
No idea!

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:53.920
Um... you don't know...?

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:55.140
No worries whatsoever!

00:04:56.260 --> 00:04:57.540
Whoa...

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:00.580
We'll just have to look at this.{shani: this is the best!}

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:05.400
T-This is the wrong map!

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:06.950
Ah... um...

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:09.530
Couldn't we just ask somebody?

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:10.670
That's right!

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:11.600
We can do that!

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:13.660
Let's go find somebody immediately!

00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:16.120
A-Akiba-san!

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:24.620
Here!

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:26.330
Please continue to show your support for me!

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:30.380
Really, thank you so much!

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:31.050
Yes!

00:05:31.050 --> 00:05:31.420
Ah.

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:33.190
City FM?

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:33.770
Yes.

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:37.180
We'll be done in another
 fifteen minutes, so it's okay.

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:39.310
Yes! We'll be there soon.

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:41.400
Yes! Bye!

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:43.080
