00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:43.100
They are on air you know!{missing line}

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:44.890
Ah... sorry about that.

00:07:44.890 --> 00:07:45.470
Well then...

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:46.640
H-Hey! Wait!

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:48.220
<i>Full Moon</i>-san!{uncommented}

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:49.980
Here's the schedule for a live concert!{edited}

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:59.240
I'm terribly sorry!

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:02.430
It's all right. I screw up like that all the time.

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:03.740
Don't worry about it.

00:08:03.740 --> 00:08:05.210
Thank you very much!

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:07.290
I'll try my best to do the next job without fail!

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:08.750
What's up next?

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:09.370
Yes!

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:11.040
A mini-concert in a department store!

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:19.700
I'm sorry,<i> Full Moon</i>-san!

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:21.380
Akiba-san, is this...?

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:24.440
The special live performance... is next week...

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:26.630
Look!

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:28.930
This young lady is <i>Full Moon</i> !{edited}

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:34.860
I'm extremely sorry for the mix-up!

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:36.880
Don't be...

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:39.280
The babies were very cute... so, it's all good!{edited}

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:41.740
Thank you for saying that. {uncommented}

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:45.440
You must be hungry.

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:47.200
The weather looks fine...

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:48.620
Let's have lunch here.

00:08:49.140 --> 00:08:50.120
Here?

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:57.860
I... used to be an adventurer.

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:59.960
I've even climbed Mt. Everest.

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:00.580
Wow!

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:02.050
That's amazing!

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:04.090
Well, it should be ready.

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:06.830
Thanks for the food!

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:11.060
It's so good!

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:12.280
I'm glad!

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:15.020
There's plenty of it, so eat as much as you want!

00:09:15.020 --> 00:09:15.640
Yes!

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:18.440
But... why did you become a manager?

00:09:20.190 --> 00:09:21.320
It's my dream.

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:24.450
When you're on an expedition...

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:27.190
There are often times when 
the going gets tough.

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:31.040
At those times...

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:33.920
...music brings you incredible strength...

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:38.590
To support those whose songs give courage to other people...

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:39.880
That's my dream.

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:42.970
<i>Full Moon</i>-san.

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:48.300
<i>Full Moon</i>-san, your dream is 
to be a top singer, right?

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:51.310
Dream, huh?

00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:59.770
It's not my only one, though...

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:03.150
Ah...

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:05.280
The weather is great, isn't it?

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:07.080
It really is...

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:08.490
Feels so good...

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:18.000
Ahhhhhhhh!!!!

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:20.380
W-What's wrong, Akiba-san?!

00:10:20.380 --> 00:10:22.400
We're going to be late for the next job!

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:22.990
Eh?!

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:24.470
What's the next one?

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.470
An appointment with Takasu-san!

00:10:26.470 --> 00:10:27.930
Oh no!

00:10:27.930 --> 00:10:29.350
This is bad... this is very bad...

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:31.370
Anyways... we have to hurry!

00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:34.100
All right... since it's come to this... {end time fixed}

00:10:34.350 --> 00:10:35.270
<i>Full Moon</i>-san.

00:10:35.270 --> 00:10:36.290
Dash!

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:41.230
<i>Full Moon</i>-san!

00:10:41.230 --> 00:10:42.480
Take a right at the next intersection!

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:42.960
Okay!

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:48.700
To gain some time...

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:51.460
...at the crossing, long jump!

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:52.070
Okay!

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:54.600
Here too, long jump!

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:56.080
Let's do it with all we've got!

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:58.710
Oh! You're doing great, <i>Full Moon</i>-san!

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:00.210
Keep that pace!

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:00.750
Okay!

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:02.960
Here we take a shortcut!

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:03.460
Okay!

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:06.160
Here, triple jump!

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:06.760
Okay!

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:09.590
