It's my fault that we are late!

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:04.210
No! I'm also at fault!

00:12:04.210 --> 00:12:05.440
I'm sorry!

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:06.820
No, I'm responsible!

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:07.730
No! It's my fault too!

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:10.530
I don't care who's fault it is! Just go inside already!

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:16.410
It's about time we should 
release your first album... {edited}

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:18.750
An album?!

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:21.960
We have around thirty demo songs here, wanna listen to them? {that last part was definitely a question, omitted in the original script}

