Damn...

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:28.680
That's strange...

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:30.400
Why isn't there any sound?

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:32.320
It's been acting up recently...

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:33.130
Sorry.

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:34.950
Looks like we might not be able to do this today. {edited}

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:37.200
Eh? No way...

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:44.070
No good...

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:45.610
Wait a sec.

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:53.950
I wonder if it can be fixed...

00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:56.700
I wanted to hear the songs...

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:04.830
All right! I'll fix it!

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:05.250
Eh?

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:06.620
A-Akiba-san?

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:08.460
You should leave it alone...

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:10.090
Takasu-san will be mad at you!

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:12.160
It's fine!

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:14.010
I'm good at video games. {shani: lol}

00:13:14.010 --> 00:13:15.010
Akiba-san!

00:13:15.010 --> 00:13:17.250
