Whoa!

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:37.450
The data for the songs has been totally erased!

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:40.600
How can you possibly make up for this?!

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:42.620
That was the data for the first album!

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:44.680
I-I'm terribly sorry!

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:46.210
So sorry, Takasu-san!

00:13:46.210 --> 00:13:47.750
Akiba-san didn't do it on purpose!

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:49.720
Would it be better if he had done it on purpose?!

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:50.820
Besides...

00:13:50.820 --> 00:13:53.760
Why on earth is an incompetent guy like you a manager anyway?!

00:13:53.990 --> 00:13:56.360
If you're just going to screw up and cause other people problems...

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:58.300
...why don't you just quit now?

00:13:58.300 --> 00:14:00.140
Get out of here! You're useless!

00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:08.940
It's just as Takasu-san says...

00:14:09.230 --> 00:14:12.030
I'm just not fit to be a manager...

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:13.700
That's not true.

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:14.640
No.

00:14:16.050 --> 00:14:17.750
That's how it really is...

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:18.200
Eh?

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:21.760
I'm always like this.

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:24.890
Doesn't matter who's management it is I am assigned with... {edited}

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:26.770
I mess up everything.

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:29.320
They always end up in failure...

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:32.460
The job with you today, <i>Full Moon</i>-san...

00:14:32.460 --> 00:14:35.010
I told myself I would do my best from the start...

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:37.760
Look how it ended up...

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:41.310
I'm hopeless, aren't I?

00:14:41.820 --> 00:14:43.390
What are you saying?!

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:47.870
Akiba-san, weren't you trying your best for me?! {edited}

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:49.400
Just before...

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:52.860
You were only doing that because I said that I wanted to hear the songs...

00:14:53.480 --> 00:14:54.440
Besides...

00:14:54.440 --> 00:14:57.950
I had many new experiences 
with you today, Akiba-san!

00:14:58.210 --> 00:14:58.760
Eh?

00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:00.070
For me...{I, getting to play outside makes no dang sense, hence the edit}

00:15:00.070 --> 00:15:02.040
Getting to play outside was always...

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:03.510
...something that I didn't get to do much...

00:15:04.490 --> 00:15:05.370
But...

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:07.620
I ate lunch like I was on a camping trip...

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:10.000
I got to run live I've never done before...

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:11.880
It was really fun!

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:14.170
<i>Full Moon</i>-san...

00:15:14.170 --> 00:15:16.220
So... don't say that.

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:17.380
Let's do our best!

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:18.990
Okay, Akiba-san?

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:22.100
Forgive me...

00:15:25.220 --> 00:15:25.980
Eh?!

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:27.190
What's with that...?!

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:30.440
No matter what... that substitute manager messes up way too much!

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:32.690
Just like a certain someone...

00:15:32.690 --> 00:15:33.570
What's that?!

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:37.160
I'm doing my best at my job as a Shinigami! {shani: Aww! Meroko! Takuto didn't even say the certain someone was you! <3}

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:40.190
He definitely works as hard 
as he can, but still fails...

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:41.950
Yey. Yep. I understand, like totally. {edited}

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:48.830
Hello?

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:51.790
Ah! Akiba-san?!

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:53.600
Thank you very much!

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:55.920
Sorry about everything yesterday.

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:59.330
Um... I've been doing some thinking...

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:02.470
I think I'll just quit working and go back to the countryside.

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:04.170
What are you saying?!

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:06.050
Please don't say that you're quitting.

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:08.980
Let's go and apologize to Takasu-san together.

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:09.690
No.

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:11.930
It's just as Takasu-san said.

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:14.190
I should stop being a manager.

00:16:14.190 --> 00:16:15.270
When I'm around...

00:16:15.270 --> 00:16:17.550
...I just cause trouble for everybody.

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:20.200
I have to leave for the station soon...

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:21.950
I'll be late for my train...

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:23.560
<i>Full Moon</i>-san.

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:25.680
Thank you for everything.

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:27.800
A-Akiba-san?

00:16:28.010 --> 00:16:29.120
Akiba-san?!

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:31.040
Hello? Akiba-san?

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:32.880
What happened?

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:35.340
Akiba-san said that he quit!

00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:38.100
We have to go to the station fast!

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:40.430
Otherwise, we'll miss his train and 
Takasu-san will still be mad...{edited}

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:42.010
Ah... what should we do?!

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:43.680
Takuto! {Shani: relying a bit too much on Takuto, eh?}

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:46.600
I got it. I got it already! Calm down!

00:17:13.620 --> 00:17:14.670
All right!

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:18.210
I... did it! {alpha time}

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:19.340
I... did it! {alpha time}

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:22.340
Akiba-san!

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:33.230
Akiba-san!

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:36.360
Akiba-san!

00:17:42.840 --> 00:17:44.990
<i>F-Full Moon</i>-san!

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:57.920
A-Akiba-san, don't quit.

00:17:59.160 --> 00:18:00.880
You came all the way here to tell me that...

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:02.090
Yes.

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:04.040
You mustn't quit, Akiba-san.

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:06.040
No.

00:18:06.710 --> 00:18:09.430
If I'm around, I'm just a burden on everyone...

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:11.310
I've already made up my mind.

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:12.520
That can't be...

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:15.000
Then... your dream to help singers...{}

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:16.480
You're just going to give up on it?

00:18:18.980 --> 00:18:20.470
Akiba-san...

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:24.560
From platform 23...

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:27.280
Train 21, bound for Komachi through Akita...

00:18:26.860 --> 00:18:28.950
Well... I'll get going.

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:30.490
will be departing shortly...

00:18:29.910 --> 00:18:31.200
Akiba-san!

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:34.120
In a short while... boarding will begin on platform 23.

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:33.410
You mustn't give up!

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:38.580
There might be many more hardships before your dream comes true...

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:41.880
But if you give up, then all hope is lost!

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:42.560
Ah...

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:52.010
Akiba-san!

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:54.520
You mustn't give up!

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:56.020
Akiba-san!

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.260
He's gone...

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:38.660
It looks like a lot happened 
while I was gone, Mitsuki. {shani: yay! Ooshige <3 is back!}

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:42.320
Takasu-san seemed to be in a jam, too...

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:45.940
Oh well... Luckily, the songs were saved in another computer.

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:46.520
Eh?

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:48.610
So the songs weren't completely lost?

00:19:48.610 --> 00:19:50.040
Well... just a copy...

00:19:50.820 --> 00:19:52.460
That's great...

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:53.910
Eh?

00:19:54.240 --> 00:19:57.000
Wait... Akiba-san didn't need to 
give up on his dream then...

00:19:57.850 --> 00:19:59.400
Hey, Mitsuki.

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:01.710
Can you come with me for a bit today?

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:02.340
Eh?

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:14.140
Okay. We're here.

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:16.890
Ooshige-san, what is this place..?

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:19.600
This will be a store that will sell <i>Full Moon</i>  merchandise. {future tense, the place is still under construction, right?}

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:20.140
Eh?

00:20:20.140 --> 00:20:21.090
Mine?

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:29.610
Manager, what about the cable here?

00:20:29.610 --> 00:20:31.070
Hmm...

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:34.150
This area should be used for the display window...

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:37.540
So the cables should be on the other side, and install the switches there.

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:38.150
Okay.

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:39.040
Sure, boss.

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:41.990
Akiba-san... {alpha time}

00:20:41.990 --> 00:20:42.920
Akiba-san... {alpha time}

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:46.670
<i>Full Moon-</i>san! Ooshige-senpai!

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:49.740
Welcome!

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:51.920
You're the first customers.

00:20:51.920 --> 00:20:53.040
Akiba-san...

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:55.850
You didn't go back to the countryside?

00:20:55.850 --> 00:20:57.600
And... you're a manager?

00:20:57.960 --> 00:21:00.610
It's just as you said, <i>Full Moon</i>-san.

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:02.140
I mustn't give up, right?

00:21:03.010 --> 00:21:06.280
That's why... I'm going to work hard here now, as the manager.

00:21:06.690 --> 00:21:08.490
It's my pleasure to work for you, <i>Full Moon</i>-san! {edited}

00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:15.050
Congratulations!

00:21:18.480 --> 00:21:19.750
Thank you very much!

00:21:20.280 --> 00:21:23.330
I'll continue to support you with everything I've got!

00:21:23.330 --> 00:21:24.490
Thank you!

00:21:24.490 --> 00:21:26.240
I'll do my best too!

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:06.440
Takuto!

00:23:06.440 --> 00:23:08.150
Isn't this good? Isn't this good?!

00:23:08.150 --> 00:23:09.270
Huh? What is?

00:23:09.270 --> 00:23:10.820
It's about that girl, of course! {edited}

00:23:10.820 --> 00:23:14.320
A dazzling summer love is in the making!

00:23:14.320 --> 00:23:16.150
Meroko will definitely cheer her on! {edited}

00:23:16.150 --> 00:23:17.110
Y-You idiot!

00:23:17.110 --> 00:23:18.360
Like that could ever happen!

00:23:18.360 --> 00:23:21.080
For her to fall in love with some weird guy from who knows where...

00:23:23.830 --> 00:23:26.580
You're terrible! Even though you belong to me!

00:23:28.540 --> 00:23:30.630
Next time on Full Moon wo Sagashite:

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:32.270
First Kiss!? {Damn it Japan, making me break consistency yet again}
